{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな～、週刊少年サンデー見てくれたカナ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！70回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\n飛路師 剛丸壱さんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈さんの～～～～カナ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、好きです。かわいい。花奈さんかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、本当に可愛いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/3273611/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/3273611/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/03/3273611/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n少し嫌な夢をみて\nこれじゃあいい目覚めじゃない！と思い\nもう一度寝てそのあとの夢が\nもっと嫌な夢で\nこれ以上夢でも嫌なものを見たくなかったので\nしぶしぶ起きました。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも！起きてからお風呂に入って\nお母さんが妹のお弁当につくった\nおかずを食べて\nチップの散歩にお母さんと3人で行ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のチップの歩き方は\nとてもお上品だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地面に足がつく感じが\nお上品だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中で公園に寄って\n久しぶりに遊具のうんていをしたんだけど\n体が重くてびっくり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"